OL,3,GNEWSARest and Be Thankful plans will be
OL,4,A'economically catastrophic' for Argyll
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have staged a protest at
OL,7,Fthe A83 Rest and Be Thankful over plans
OL,8,Fto introduce four years of traffic
OL,9,Frestrictions at the landslip-plagued
OL,10,Fstretch of road.
OL,12,FAbout 20 large vehicles including
OL,13,Ftractors and haulage trucks drove in
OL,14,Fconvoy and beeped their horns to
OL,15,Fhighlight an issue they feel will be
OL,16,Feconomically disastrous for the region.
OL,18,FThey were joined by local SNP MP
OL,19,FBrendan O'Hara, who has launched a
OL,20,Fpetition to call on Transport Scotland
OL,21,Fto change its plans.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
