OL,3,GNEWSARest and Be Thankful plans will be
OL,4,A'economically catastrophic' for Argyll
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Scotland said the issue was
OL,7,Fbeing "treated with the seriousness it
OL,8,Fdeserves".
